    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Connect Your Systems Through Seamless Integration
        </h2>

        <p>
            Many organizations depend on multiple applications to manage sales,
            finance, inventory, customer relationships, logistics, and internal
            operations. When these platforms operate independently, employees
            may need to duplicate information, reconcile inconsistent records,
            or rely on manual processes to complete everyday tasks.
        </p>

        <p>
            System integration connects applications and enables them to
            exchange information through defined interfaces and workflows.
            APIs, middleware, event-driven architectures, and automated data
            pipelines can help businesses establish consistent communication
            between their technology platforms.
        </p>

        <p>
            OnnaSoft helps organizations evaluate integration requirements and
            implement solutions that improve interoperability. Integrations
            may connect enterprise software, custom applications, third-party
            services, databases, and cloud platforms.
        </p>

        <p>
            Effective integration requires more than moving information between
            systems. Data validation, authentication, error handling, logging,
            monitoring, and version management help maintain reliability as
            applications and business requirements evolve.
        </p>
    </section>

