        <p>
            Cloud platforms and DevOps practices help organizations standardize
            these activities through automation and repeatable workflows.
            Infrastructure as code, continuous integration, continuous delivery,
            container orchestration, and centralized monitoring can reduce
            manual effort and improve deployment consistency.
        </p>

        <p>
            OnnaSoft can help businesses modernize delivery pipelines, improve
            infrastructure management, and align deployment processes with
            security and reliability requirements. These improvements can also
            make it easier to identify operational issues and respond to changes
            in application demand.
        </p>

        <p>
            The right infrastructure strategy balances availability, performance,
            security, maintainability, and cost. Selecting appropriate
            technologies based on these factors helps businesses operate
            digital services more effectively over time.
        </p>
    </section>

